// A static a foreign (stub) class does not declare is the checker's error,
// with the near names the stub does declare, whether the class was imported
// or reached by its bare `rust.std` name. `Duration.ofMillis(5)` used to pass
// and fail in rustc (sweep C2): Rust's constructors are `from_millis` and
// `from_secs`.
void main() {
    var a = Duration.ofMillis(5);
    var b = Duration.fromSecs(2);
    var c = Duration.form_secs(1);
    var ok = Duration.from_millis(5);
    print(ok.as_millis());
}
